 ('COMP-S02','Portfolio Payroll','Payroll recruitment services','https://www.theportfoliogroup.com/payroll/recruitment-services/','Permanent; Temporary/Contract; Executive Search; Client Solutions','Declared recruitment models and assessment approach. Immediate support language is not a guaranteed fill time or proof of available talent.','Permanent operational recruitment, temporary/project cover and senior leadership search are distinct declared routes; its outsourced recruitment process is not outsourced payroll processing.'),
 ('COMP-S04','Oakleaf Partnership','Payroll Capabilities','https://www.oakleafpartnership.com/business-areas/payroll/payroll-capabilities','Payroll Capabilities; Recent placements include','Published role/sector examples and aggregate performance claims are self-published, not independently audited. Page scope does not establish the cause of any need.','Interim/permanent payroll recruitment spans operational, implementation, leadership and auto-enrolment specialisms. Listed role/sector examples demonstrate inspectable publisher claims, not a complete capability census.'),
 ('COMP-S05','Middlemore','Payroll Search','https://middlemore.co.uk/payroll-search/','Payroll Search on a Global Scale; Beyond the Shortlist; Post Project Report','Live page wording differs from indexed/search and earlier page text. Use the live retained body for current scope. Declared expertise and reporting do not establish achieved placement or payroll performance.','The current live page describes permanent appointments, interim leadership and transformation work, with technical capability, leadership judgement and stakeholder influence assessed. Recruitment analytics and brand-perception reporting are separate from employer payroll outcome evaluation.'),
 ('COMP-S06','Hays','Accountancy and Finance recruitment agency','https://www.hays.co.uk/recruitment/accountancy-finance','Specialists in accountancy and finance recruitment; Roles we recruit for','Broad finance page includes payroll. Adjacent finance case studies and workforce services cannot be treated as payroll-specific results or executive search availability.','Payroll sits within broader finance recruitment offering permanent/interim/contract routes, alongside systems, transformation and workforce planning language. Broad coverage does not prove fit for a particular payroll mandate.'),
 ('COMP-S07','Robert Half','Accountancy and finance recruitment agency','https://www.roberthalf.com/gb/en/finance-accounting-recruitment','Choose your ideal hiring model or consultancy solution; FAQ on roles; temp/contract finance talent','Finance-wide service/consultancy scope. UK Payroll Manager inclusion is not evidence of a US Payroll Director placement. Generic performance claims and current salary-guide labels are not adopted.','UK finance recruitment includes Payroll Manager, permanent and temporary/interim staffing; the page separately describes consulting with Protiviti. Staffing a role, owning a change programme and running payroll remain different contracts/outcomes.'),
 ('COMP-S08','Frazer Jones','Delivering payroll and HR operations talent during organisational change','https://www.frazerjones.com/case-studies/delivering-payroll-and-hr-operations-talent-during-organisational-change/','The challenge; The solution; The outcome; Roles; Region','Publisher case and named client testimonial, not independent audit. No comparable cost, duration, payroll error or continuity metric supplied. Main payroll landing page timed out repeatedly; its current broad claims are not silently carried forward.','The London aosphere de-merger case describes HR/payroll structure rebuilding and supplied interim and permanent talent. This is a specific publisher-reported example of maintaining operations during organisational change, not proof of sector-wide outcomes.'),
 ('COMP-S09','Oakleaf Partnership','Interim Payroll and Pensions Manager','https://www.oakleafpartnership.com/jobs/interim-payroll-and-pensions-manager-pr-016244','Job duties; Key Skills; Posted 12 October 2026','Recruiter-published vacancy for an independent school, six-month FTC. An advert is evidence of a requested role, not completed hiring, realised shortage or achieved performance. No salary benchmarking inference.','The advertised role combines payroll inputs, statutory submissions, control-account reconciliation, pension schemes, audit and corrective action. This illustrates domain-specific task fit and temporary cover without implying an extra person alone resolves the process.'),
